Hi Gabriel,

The multilevel model would account for over-time correlation within a country (though it does not recognize time sequence).  If that?s okay with you, then you could go with the multilevel model, which is available in our mediation package.  Unfortunately, the current version of our package does not have other types of models that can handle panel data.

Best,
